## 1. PRODUCT DEFINITION

**Name:** D-Ray Show — Breaking News Desk (public site: "D-Ray Show Blog News")
**Tagline:** YOUR DAILY GLOBAL UPDATE
**Strapline:** Latest Updates. Global Coverage. Unbiased Reporting.
**Owner:** D-Ray Show, a Nigerian media house covering sports, politics and current happenings (Nigeria / Africa / World).
**Purpose:** A private, mobile-first PWA workspace for 5 staff that (a) monitors breaking news from curated world/Africa/Nigeria channels, (b) rewrites each break with an AI in the house editorial style into 6 ready-to-copy formats, and (c) publishes full articles to a real, SEO-ready public blog hosted on the same deployment.
**Hard constraints:** built and maintained **entirely from a phone**; hosted only on **GitHub + Vercel**; **no custom domain** (uses `*.vercel.app`); **no paid backend/database** — free tiers only.

