## 6. PWA LAYER

**manifest.json:** name "D-Ray Show Newsroom", short_name "D-Ray Desk", `start_url "/"`, `display "standalone"`, `background_color #0A1220`, `theme_color #1E5AA8`, icons → `logo.png` (192 & 512 entries).
**sw.js (MUST be network-first):** cache name versioned (e.g. `dray-v3`); `install → skipWaiting()`; `activate → delete old caches + clients.claim()`; `fetch → try network, cache a copy, fall back to cache on failure`.
*Rationale:* an earlier cache-first worker served stale builds and caused "nothing updates" bugs — network-first is mandatory.
**Install:** browser → Add to Home Screen.

