## 10. BLOG PUBLISHING ENGINE ("D-Ray Show Blog News")

**Transport:** GitHub REST `PUT /repos/{owner}/{repo}/contents/{path}` with `Authorization: token {PAT}`; body `{message, content: base64, sha?}` (upsert: GET meta first, include `sha` if exists). Token (`repo` scope) + `owner/repo` stored on device.
**Slug:** `title-slug-{base36 timestamp}`; URL `{origin}/blog/{slug}.html` (permanent; edits reuse slug so links never break).
**Image upload:** file → canvas resize (max 1200 px) → JPEG q0.82 → base64 → commit `blog/img/{slug}.jpg`; `<img class="hero">` in post; reused on edit unless replaced.
**Post page template:** light editorial theme; head = `<title>{headline} | D-Ray Show Blog News</title>`, meta description (first 160 chars of body), canonical, favicon, OG/Twitter tags (og:image = post image or logo), JSON-LD `NewsArticle`; body = brand header, H2 headline, meta line (date GMT • credit), hero image, paragraphs, dark credit box (credit + sign-off + handles + link to `/blog/`), footer strapline.
**Index:** `blog/index.json` array of `{id,title,desc,source,img,date,url,body}`; newest first; also powers in-app Blog list and public homepage.
**In-app Blog tab:** `✍ CREATE NEWS` composer (title, source, image file input with preview, story textarea, publish/update button) + published list with `🔗 COPY LINK • 📤 SHARE (navigator.share) • 🌐 OPEN • ️ EDIT` (edit prefills composer; UPDATE rewrites same slug). Desk's `📤 PUBLISH` sends generated `title`+`full` straight through.
**Public homepage (`blog/index.html`):** brand header, search input (client-side filter), post cards from `index.json`, social footer.
**SEO path:** per-post meta + JSON-LD + canonical + OG; submit site once to Google Search Console.

