## 13. DEPLOYMENT RUNBOOK (phone-only)

1. GitHub: create repo; add `index.html`, `manifest.json`, `sw.js`, upload `logo.png`; add `blog/index.html`.
2. Vercel: import repo → Deploy (zero-config; `api/` becomes serverless automatically).
3. App → Settings: save Grok/Groq key; save GitHub PAT (`repo` scope) + `owner/repo`; tap **🛠 INSTALL NEWS RELAY** (app writes `api/feeds.js` itself); wait ~20 s; 🔄.
4. Add to Home Screen. Optional: Google Search Console verification.

