## 14. CONSTRAINTS & ROADMAP

Accepted trade-offs: client-side API keys (private 5-user tool), client-side PIN auth, public CORS proxies only as fallback. Known risks: proxy rate-limits (solved by relay), GitHub API rate (5k/h with token — fine), SW stale-cache (solved by network-first).
Roadmap: push notifications, Supabase auth/roles enforcement, per-editor approval flow, Pidgin VO option, custom domain + sitemap auto-generation, more direct feeds.
